1
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:01,583
Fine!

2
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:05,708
If you’re keeping these
rats, the wedding is dead!

3
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:15,125
Go tell Livia right
now  the wedding is off!

4
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:16,125
Exactly.

5
00:00:16,833 --> 00:00:17,958
The engagement is over.

6
00:00:18,541 --> 00:00:19,000
servants! 

7
00:00:19,666 --> 00:00:20,250
servants! 

8
00:00:21,083 --> 00:00:22,083
My lord, please …

9
00:00:22,208 --> 00:00:23,500
Get the hell
out of my way!

10
00:00:25,791 --> 00:00:28,291
A disowned failure
doesn’t deserve my daughter.

11
00:00:36,625 --> 00:00:37,500
What?!

12
00:00:38,791 --> 00:00:40,916
He’s disrespecting my family in public?!

13
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:43,458
I’ll handle this right now!

14
00:00:48,666 --> 00:00:50,291
Severin, apologize!

15
00:00:50,291 --> 00:00:50,833
Now!

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,500
They insulted my brothers first.

17
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,583
Why should I apologize?

18
00:00:55,041 --> 00:00:56,458
Why are you being so stupid?!

19
00:00:56,625 --> 00:00:58,916
This is your only
shot at a real future!

20
00:00:59,083 --> 00:00:59,958
Ma’am, don’t worry.

21
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,833
It’s on me.

22
00:01:02,833 --> 00:01:03,583
I’ll fix it.

23
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:06,250
My lord, I’m sorry.

24
00:01:06,750 --> 00:01:08,750
We’re just stupid diggers

25
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:09,791
who didn’t know the rules.

26
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:11,958
We’re leaving right now.

27
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:13,416
Please don’t blame Severin.

28
00:01:13,416 --> 00:01:14,125
David, stop!

29
00:01:14,166 --> 00:01:15,416
You did nothing wrong!

30
00:01:15,791 --> 00:01:17,500
Why are you begging these people?!

31
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,500
Severin, we know
you’re a good man.

32
00:01:20,083 --> 00:01:22,416
Marrying a noble lady is your chance to finally rise.

33
00:01:23,291 --> 00:01:25,541
You won’t have to
dig with us anymore.

34
00:01:28,083 --> 00:01:30,333
Just remember us when you’re
living in a castle,

35
00:01:32,125 --> 00:01:33,125
yeah?

36
00:01:34,166 --> 00:01:36,166
I will,I promise.

37
00:01:36,291 --> 00:01:37,083
Keep dreaming.

38
00:01:37,083 --> 00:01:39,000
I’ve already told Livia
the wedding is canceled.

39
00:01:39,041 --> 00:01:40,583
A disowned Carter bastard

40
00:01:40,583 --> 00:01:41,958
has no claim on my daughter.

41
00:01:42,666 --> 00:01:43,000
Fine.

42
00:01:44,083 --> 00:01:44,916
Cancel it then.
